<title>JAPAN: Sony gains as investors look to blue chips.</title>
<headline>Sony gains as investors look to blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp shares gained in Monday morning trade as investors, stymied by a lack of market direction, moved to buy blue-chip issues, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0030 GMT, the shares were up 100 yen at 8,870.</p>
<p>&quot;It is not as if any new buy factors have emerged,&quot; a &quot;Big Four&quot; broker said. &quot;The issue is gathering attention as it is regarded as one which is likely to lead the market.&quot;</p>
</text>
